<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Plum Blossoms Do Not Fall Lightly, 2025</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;By the mid-2020s, tensions between China and its neighbors have escalated.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;China's leaders believe it must&amp;nbsp;dominate the East China Sea and South China Sea to protect its position as a global leader.&amp;nbsp; This has put it into conflict with other nations in the region.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Several minor incidents have taken place during&amp;nbsp;the last few years.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Two days ago, 30 miles southwest of Kuroshima Island,&amp;nbsp;a flight of Japanese F-15s encountered a flight of Chinese J-20s.&amp;nbsp; The J-20s&amp;nbsp;engaged in manuevers that convinced the Japanese pilots they were in danger of being attacked, and they fired on the Chinese aircraft.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;In the ensuing battle, two Chinese aircraft and one Japanese aircraft were shot down.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;China has been left in a difficult position.&amp;nbsp; If it does nothing, it risks looking weak, something its current leaders will not accept.&amp;nbsp; But a retaliatory strike, not meant as a prelude to conquest but simply&amp;nbsp;to weaken and humble its rivals, might spark&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;larger war.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
